          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta nindi, Bayi ayidimba kudi Hezekiyaku; muŋa yena hakatweshakuyipulwisha kudi yenaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiya bayi ayileja kukuhwelela Yehovaku, nindi, Yehova chalala wukutupulwisha, hela nimukaliwu hiyakawuhanakudi mwanta wakuAshuruku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi mutiyiliia Hezekiyaku, muloŋa mwanta wakuAshuri nindi, Tutiyaŋanenu, mwidiki mwinzi kudami; mwakadyaŋa nyivinyu yenu wejima wenu, mwaka dyaŋa niyikuyu yenu wejima wenu, mwakanwapa wejima wenu meji akumashimenu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nichina kenza nakuyifumishamu, nakayitwali kwituŋa dafwana neyi ituŋa denwenu aweni, ituŋa datidiku navinyu, ituŋa dayakudya namatempa anyivinyu, ituŋa damanji aolive nawuchi, mwakahandaŋa mwakabuli kufwa. Bayi mumutiyilila chakuyidimbekayi Hezekiya nindi, Yehova wukutupulwishaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
