          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana kaHilikiya Eliyakimi wadiŋi mukulumpi wawakwetala, ninsoneki Shebina, nimwana kaAsafwi Yowa mukwakusoneka nsaŋu, hiyakuya kudi Hezekiya namahinawu akutabola dehi, hiyakumuleja mazu aRabishake.",
